{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\091.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[268, 43], [459, 53], [457, 94], [266, 84]]}, {"text": "FICE", "conf": 0.579, "box": [[1511, 128], [1575, 137], [1570, 170], [1506, 161]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[260, 178], [422, 185], [420, 224], [258, 217]]}, {"text": "Here we are considering the mass of rice with its price.", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[254, 240], [1097, 236], [1098, 292], [254, 296]]}, {"text": "Note it down", "conf": 0.852, "box": [[1181, 237], [1387, 240], [1387, 274], [1181, 271]]}, {"text": "We can write it as by removing units:", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[255, 304], [831, 312], [831, 357], [254, 350]]}, {"text": "Unit rate is the rate where one", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[1175, 303], [1581, 319], [1580, 359], [1173, 343]]}, {"text": "quantity is always 1.", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[1177, 363], [1440, 362], [1440, 396], [1177, 397]]}, {"text": "Rs 2200/10 Kg = 2200 : 10", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[252, 376], [671, 382], [670, 424], [251, 418]]}, {"text": "To find per kg rate, we will simplify the ratio.", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[251, 439], [937, 446], [937, 492], [250, 485]]}, {"text": "2200 + 10", "conf": 0.727, "box": [[452, 516], [614, 520], [613, 557], [451, 553]]}, {"text": "2200 : 10", "conf": 0.803, "box": [[248, 537], [408, 542], [407, 576], [247, 571]]}, {"text": "(reduce it in unit rate by dividing both terms by 10.)", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[641, 541], [1437, 542], [1437, 585], [640, 584]]}, {"text": "10 10", "conf": 0.64, "box": [[473, 575], [590, 575], [590, 610], [473, 610]]}, {"text": "220", "conf": 0.75, "box": [[439, 639], [509, 642], [507, 682], [438, 679]]}, {"text": "So, the rate of per kilogram rice is Rs 220.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[237, 742], [892, 752], [892, 794], [236, 785]]}, {"text": "Example 3:", "conf": 0.832, "box": [[237, 798], [430, 804], [429, 843], [236, 838]]}, {"text": "Milk", "conf": 0.754, "box": [[1532, 839], [1609, 839], [1609, 875], [1532, 875]]}, {"text": "The price of 12 litre milk is Rs 2160. Find the unit rate (or per litre rate) of milk.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[234, 864], [1466, 880], [1465, 919], [233, 903]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.806, "box": [[228, 935], [392, 939], [391, 977], [227, 973]]}, {"text": "Here we are considering the volume of milk with its price.", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[221, 997], [1133, 1009], [1132, 1049], [220, 1037]]}, {"text": "We can write it as by removing units:", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[223, 1061], [816, 1070], [815, 1110], [222, 1101]]}, {"text": "Rs 2160/12 litre = 2160 : 12", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[219, 1128], [670, 1134], [669, 1171], [218, 1165]]}, {"text": "To find per kg rate, we will simplify the ratio.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[218, 1201], [927, 1208], [927, 1247], [217, 1240]]}, {"text": "2160 - 12", "conf": 0.727, "box": [[424, 1275], [589, 1277], [588, 1312], [424, 1310]]}, {"text": "2160 : 12", "conf": 0.782, "box": [[214, 1302], [373, 1302], [373, 1335], [214, 1335]]}, {"text": "(reduce it in unit rate by dividing both terms by 12.)", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[623, 1301], [1425, 1315], [1424, 1355], [622, 1340]]}, {"text": "12 - 12", "conf": 0.617, "box": [[446, 1333], [569, 1333], [569, 1367], [446, 1367]]}, {"text": "180", "conf": 0.631, "box": [[414, 1394], [481, 1394], [481, 1432], [414, 1432]]}, {"text": "So, the rate of per liter milk is Rs 180.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[208, 1503], [812, 1504], [812, 1543], [207, 1542]]}, {"text": "Exercise4.6", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[835, 1610], [1063, 1618], [1061, 1662], [833, 1654]]}, {"text": "Find the rate for each of the following.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[279, 1698], [945, 1703], [945, 1749], [279, 1744]]}, {"text": "a) 28 kilometers covered in 4 hours", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[281, 1774], [849, 1768], [849, 1805], [281, 1810]]}, {"text": "b) 16 metre rope for Rs 1376.", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[1039, 1774], [1498, 1786], [1497, 1829], [1038, 1817]]}, {"text": "c) 108 words typed in 6 minutes", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[279, 1821], [801, 1812], [802, 1852], [280, 1860]]}, {"text": "d) 8 kg of mangoes in Rs 400", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[1039, 1822], [1497, 1833], [1496, 1876], [1038, 1866]]}, {"text": "e) Rs 6000 for fencing 50 metre boundary", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[276, 1864], [950, 1861], [950, 1907], [276, 1910]]}, {"text": "89", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[891, 2001], [942, 2001], [942, 2041], [891, 2041]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.865, "box": [[284, 2013], [581, 2000], [583, 2034], [286, 2047]]}]}